# Story 13: Managing Tabs (##tab) (40s)
# Hook: The ##tab command is your full tab control center -- list, inspect, delete, and pipeline.
# Duration: 40s
# Source: story-013-managing-tabs.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 5

[00:00.0 --> 00:04.0]
The ##tab command is your tab control center -- list, inspect, delete, and toggle pipelines.

[00:04.0 --> 00:14.0]
##tab list shows every tab with its ID and how many panes it holds.

[00:14.0 --> 00:23.0]
##tab list-panes drills into the active tab and lists the panes inside it.

[00:23.0 --> 00:31.0]
##tab delete with an ID removes a tab you no longer need.

[00:31.0 --> 00:40.0]
And ##tab pipeline enable turns on pipeline mode for the tab; disable turns it back off.

